#: ../../translations.rst:2 a061000d20ed42beb0af433ceff8a1f3
msgid "Translations and publishing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../translations.rst:4 5c00a930958548dfb226efde3b1237e8
msgid ""
"The documentation is published as two static Sphinx builds under ``/en/``"
" and ``/fr/`` in the public `RewakeDevelopmentDocumentation repository "
"<https://github.com/techRewake/RewakeDevelopmentDocumentation>`_. The "
"root page links to both languages. The generated site includes HTML and "
"the assets Sphinx needs to render it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../translations.rst:10 2271c8aa3ce849758bda76b9e30bf505
msgid ""
"Translations use Sphinx gettext catalogs in ``docs/locale/<language>/``. "
"The source pages currently mix English and French. Each language catalog "
"translates pages written in the other language; untranslated text falls "
"back to its source language until its catalog is completed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../translations.rst:15 9843c43ff59e4e81a8c0040d20e8ba61
msgid ""
"To refresh the translation templates and create or update the French "
"catalogs:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../translations.rst:22 55b833c0af574362b31712acfebf33e3
msgid ""
"Translate the ``msgstr`` values in the relevant "
"``docs/locale/<language>/`` catalogs while preserving Sphinx roles, "
"references, code, and markup. Build either language locally with:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../translations.rst:31 41f120ca63e943448f3d4d10ca1d745d
msgid ""
"The ``Publish documentation`` GitHub Actions workflow builds both "
"languages on pushes to ``main`` that affect the docs, then publishes the "
"generated site to the public repository. It needs a ``DOCS_DEPLOY_TOKEN``"
" Actions secret in the source repository. Create a fine-grained personal "
"access token with Contents: Read and write access to "
"``techRewake/RewakeDevelopmentDocumentation``, then add it as that "
"secret. The workflow can also be started manually from the Actions tab."
msgstr ""

